HOW TO INSTALL

1.  copy whole contents of this project in your machine
    ex.) cd ${HOME}; git clone https://github.com/linguaomnis/forkexec.git;
    or simply via zip

2.  do "make" for this project
    ex.) make -C ${HOME}/forkexec/src;

3.  do "make install" for this project
    ex.) make install -C ${HOME}/forkexec/src;

4.  add path ${HOME}/forkexec/bin to $PATH
    and add path ${HOME}/forkexec/lib to $LD_LIBRARY_PATH
    in ${HOME}.bashrc,
    ex.) open ${HOME}.bashrc to edit it

        from:
        > # User specific environment
        > if ! [[ "$PATH" =~ "$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/bin:" ]]; then
        >     PATH="$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/bin:$PATH"
        > fi
        > export PATH

        to:
        > # User specific environment
        > export FORKEXEC="$HOME/forkexec";
        > if ! [[ "$PATH" =~ "$FORKEXEC/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/bin:" ]]; then
        >     PATH="$FORKEXEC/bin:$HOME/.local/bin:$HOME/bin:$PATH"
        > fi
        > export PATH
        > if ! [[ "$LD_LIBRARY_PATH" =~ "$FORKEXEC/lib:" ]]; then
        >     LD_LIBRARY_PATH="$FORKEXEC/lib:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH"
        > fi
        > export LD_LIBRARY_PATH

HOW TO UNINSTALL

1.  do "make uninstall" for this project
    ex.) make uninstall -C ${HOME}/forkexec/src;

